  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    A = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    A.sort(reverse = True)\r\n    P = [0] * (3 * n + 1)\r\n    for i in range(3 * n):\r\n        P[i + 1] = P[i] + A[i]\r\n    ms = -1\r\n    k = n * 3\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(n + 1):\r\n        l = 2 * n - i\r\n        h = 3 * n - 2 * i\r\n        \r\n        if k > h:\r\n            k = h\r\n        while k > l:\r\n            j = n * 6 - i * 3 -2 * k\r\n            if 3 * A[k - 1] < A[j] + A[j + 1]:\r\n                k -= 1\r\n            else:\r\n                break\r\n        j = 6 * n -3 * i - 2 * k\r\n        curr = (P[i] << 1) + P[j] + 3 * P[k]\r\n        \r\n        if curr > ms:\r\n            ms = curr\r\n    print(ms)",
